
@startuml
title Figure 4 — Polyglot JSON I/O (out-of-process)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BBBBBB
scale 0.9

participant "Reactive Engine" as Rx
participant "Polyglot Wrapper" as Wrap
participant "External Exec (C++/Rust/JS/R)" as Ext

Rx -> Wrap: call(node=ArtifactRemoval)
note over Wrap
write input_<name>_<id>.json
end note
Wrap -> Ext: run process with args
Ext -> Ext: compute
note over Ext
read input.json\nwrite output.json
end note
Ext --> Wrap: exit code (0=ok)
note over Wrap
read output_<name>_<id>.json
end note
Wrap --> Rx: outputs / errors
@enduml
